WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:41.920
The place where I left Leina
was engulfed in flames.

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.100
But I can't hold Ple responsible.

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:50.520
In any era, children are
always the victims of war.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:58.230
RUNAWAY ROUX

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:10.130
To escape from Haman's fleet,
the Argama made a hasty retreat.

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:18.550
The Gundam Team had to return to the ship.
We couldn't search for Leina's body.

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:22.760
What a mess!

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:25.800
I was glad I didn't have to wear
a normal suit... But this wind!

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.930
It's perfect for waking
you up, isn't it?

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:30.810
So perfect that I can't even yawn!

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:33.440
Judau really made extra
work for us this time!

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:49.210
Good work!

00:02:50.430 --> 00:02:53.390
Judau still hasn't come
out of the Core Fighter?

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:56.620
N-No, sir... Astonaige is
working on retrieving it!

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:00.320
- Anything from the Audhumla?
- No instructions!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.630
So late... What are they doing?

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:06.970
Mondo! The knee cushioning's too tight.
Check it out for me!

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:09.050
Doesn't it just need to be oiled?

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:11.350
I think maybe sand got
into the knee connection!

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:15.480
Oh, brother. I gotta take it
apart and oil it, then.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:17.480
Hey, where's Judau?

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.230
He's still on the catapult deck.

00:03:19.230 --> 00:03:21.730
Astonaige is looking
over the docking blocks.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.570
- Where's Judau?
- They should be getting him about now, right?

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.320
He's still in shock.

00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.090
Don't be so silly!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:32.410
For crying out loud, if a mobile suit pilot
is moping over his sister's death--

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.700
"... he won't be able to fight," right?

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.310
Don't be such a know-it-all!

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:40.560
All Double Zeta's parts
are now safely stowed.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.300
- You can close the hatch now!
- Roger!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.830
Judau?

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.230
Judau!

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:57.990
Judau can't sense Leina's
presence anymore.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:04:02.810
Since Judau's become more of a Newtype,
he can feel his sister's death viscerally.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.690
Are you saying Judau can sense things
over such a huge distance?

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:09.090
It's a latent ability that
humans used to have.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:13.090
But people rely so much on technology
that they can't feel it anymore.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:14.660
All right, I get it!

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:17.790
But Judau's not a perfect
Newtype yet, right?

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.560
Maybe he's just letting himself
drown in his emotions!

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:23.500
- Where are you going?
- I'm going to open Judau's eyes for him!

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:25.800
Just leave him alone!

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.930
Everyone has times when
they want to be left alone.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:32.220
So just leave him alone.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:33.300
Beecha?

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.660
They said to make do with petroleum jelly
'cause we're running low on oil.

00:04:36.660 --> 00:04:39.560
You're kidding me! It's a mobile suit!

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:42.240
- What if it breaks because of that?!
- H-Hold on!

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:47.370
Wow, what's with those two?

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.240
Judau... please open the canopy.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:53.700
Judau!

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:57.240
Stop it! We have to wait for
Judau to come out on his own!

00:04:57.470 --> 00:05:00.710
If we leave him be,
he'll stay in there forever!

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:03.080
We need a fighting Judau!

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:04.500
You can't!

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.170
Judau deserves our pity.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.210
Nobody should be bothering him!

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:10.480
- Get out of my way, Ple!
- Don't wanna!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:14.850
If you care about Judau,
please do as I say, Ple!

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.760
I don't wanna!

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:23.610
Roux! You're so mean!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:31.950
Judau...

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.180
Judau! Get out of the cockpit!

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:46.970
Come on, hurry up!

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:50.060
Leina...

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.440
I didn't think you were
this kind of guy!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:57.300
Look, people throughout history have died
for reasons just as ridiculous, or worse.

00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:02.730
Thousands of people have been pointlessly killed by bad orders.

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:05.850
But people bore the pain!
They persevered!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:07.810
That has nothing to do with Judau!

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:11.010
It does, because we're in a war!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.610
War...?

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:14.400
That's right! This is a war!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:17.960
If you're mad about all this,
then rediscover your will to fight!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:21.630
Leina.... Leina is DEAD!

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:26.550
Just leave me alone!

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:28.940
I guess I thought too highly of you.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:31.690
Then just sit here forever,
crying like a baby.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:34.630
Damn you... I've had
enough of your drivel!

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:37.050
Someone, get a hold of Judau!

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.040
Judau!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.700
- Let me go!
- I can't!

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:44.520
You might do something crazy now!
We need you to stay put!

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:46.150
Judau...!

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:04.540
We must prevent the Argama
from joining with Karaba, Glemy.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:05.330
Yes, my lady.

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:10.930
However weak they may be, they could
threaten us through strength of numbers.

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:12.550
Yes, I understand.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:16.850
By the way, what happened to that girl?
What was her name... Leina?

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:19.550
She was only a child.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.720
Do those words come from your heart?

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.230
I do not comprehend your meaning.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.980
So young, and yet so cold-hearted.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.200
I merely spoke the truth.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:36.170
Then I would like you to
physically demonstrate that truth.

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:37.280
Yes, my lady!

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.880
I will seize control of
all the Titans' facilities.

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.580
You will seize all of Karaba's.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.530
Yes, my lady!

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:46.880
Do not forget that we are linked by
the blood ties of the Zabi family.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:48.920
Yes, my lady!

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:52.230
- Outta my way, Ple!
- Let go!

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:53.940
I feel sorry for Judau.

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:56.210
People should be nice to him!

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.720
Let him go!

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.180
But, Captain...

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:00.260
It's all right!

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:01.350
Okay...

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:05.060
Are you okay, Judau?

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:06.610
Go away!

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:11.770
Nobody... nobody understands
what I'm feeling right now!

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.770
Judau, I understand how you feel!

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:18.240
I'm not Leina, so I probably
can't take Leina's place.

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:21.620
But from today, I can
be your little sister.

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.380
I-Is that no good?

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:31.580
But...

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.790
I'm...

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:34.930
just some other kid.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:47.100
If Karaba is going to try to intercept us,
I think Algeria is probably the best place.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:53.650
El Goléa has an airport, and we have
reliable reports of an AEUG outpost there.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:55.450
Right.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:09:00.990
Take the Dreissen team,
and attack El Goléa! I will follow.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.040
Yes, sir!

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:04.990
Do as Venus pleases...

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:08.130
and she is sure to
bring Mars with her.

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:10.500
Such nonsense.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:14.040
Only a fool would die for love.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.500
If that love is unrequited,
even more so.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:20.380
But this situation works in August's favor.

00:09:20.380 --> 00:09:23.890
Lady Haman will have no choice
but to rely on me.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.890
Dreissen team, launch!

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:29.980
The operation is as we discussed!

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:31.570
I wish all of you the best!

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.660
August Guidan, launching!

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:47.080
Damn Guidan... he thinks he can
keep me under observation.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.830
Did you see how Roux
was behaving earlier?

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.470
Yeah... she was being a bit hard on him.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:02.670
Beecha, can you grab that for me?

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:04.770
What should we do, Beecha?

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.650
- Coming right up!
- Thanks!

00:10:09.650 --> 00:10:10.980
Here!

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:16.730
Beecha! You did that on purpose!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:20.280
Now, time to see if the knee
cushioning is fixed or not.

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:21.610
You wait up!

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:23.240
Beecha, she's coming!

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:24.820
What's the meaning of this?

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:26.860
You don't have to harass me like this!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:30.890
Then you shouldn't have stomped on a
miserable guy's heart with your muddy shoes.

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:32.540
Is this about Judau?

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:35.170
Hmph, talk about a warped
way to show your support.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.750
What would you know about that?

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.880
- I know plenty!
- There's no way!

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:42.340
That's enough. After all,
you're not from Shangri-La.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:44.220
There's no way you could understand.

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.310
What Roux said wasn't
completely wrong, though.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:51.250
Judau has survived this far because
he has the elements of a Newtype.

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:56.140
If he can grow into a powerful Newtype,
that would be a plus for the AEUG as well.

00:10:56.350 --> 00:10:58.650
That's got nothing to do with us.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:00.650
What are you, an AEUG stooge?

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:02.440
This whole argument is childish.

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.900
What?! Damn you!

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.490
What are you doing?!

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.740
Hey, girls like you shouldn't
be hitting people!

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.240
Mondo started it!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:10.950
What if I get a hernia from this?!

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:12.760
If that's what you want,
I can give it to you!

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:16.120
Yes... we should, of course,
be treating Ple as a prisoner.

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.630
Captain Bright! We have an
emergency communication!

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:20.090
From the Audhumla?

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:25.800
"What appears to be a Neo Zeon mobile suit
team is attacking a base near El Goléa.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:29.050
Dispatch the Argama's
mobile suit team immediately.

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:30.510
--Hayato."

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:33.600
Sound the alarms! All hands
to level 1 battle stations!

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:34.390
Yes, sir!

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.140
Lowering altitude! All hands...

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:36.940
That's enough!

00:11:37.100 --> 00:11:39.170
Just because you were
a volunteer soldier...!

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.360
Prepare for launch!

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:42.650
You acted like this didn't
concern you until now!

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:43.650
Back off!

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.530
Guys, we've got enemies incoming!

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.290
Then what, she's deserting?

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:49.910
Gonna run away before the enemy?

00:11:49.910 --> 00:11:51.950
Look, Roux Louka's running
away in the Core Fighter!

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:53.280
I've had enough of you!

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.830
Captain! Apparently Roux Louka
has gone AWOL!

00:11:55.830 --> 00:11:57.410
What?

00:11:58.010 --> 00:11:59.960
Why would she go off on her own?

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.580
Roux... what in the world happened?!

00:12:14.490 --> 00:12:16.820
Beecha Oleg, Hyaku Shiki, moving out!

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:22.610
Elle Vianno, Zeta Gundam, moving out!

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:33.200
Mondo Agake, Mk. II, moving out!

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:34.880
All right!

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:37.140
J-Judau!

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:39.160
Are you sure you're okay to sortie?

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:42.220
I'm just tired of sitting around
in my room. That's all!

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.460
True enough! Good luck!

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.920
Judau! I'll go with
you in the Core Base!

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:48.680
I'm counting on you!

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.020
Judau!

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.230
Cheer up, Judau!

00:13:00.230 --> 00:13:02.900
Judau isn't really Judau
if he's not cheerful!

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.690
I know that, Ple.

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:08.070
I don't think going to war is
exactly cheerful, but...

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.660
I think Miss Roux might be right.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:17.370
- Let's go, Iino!
- Roger!

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:19.210
Judau Ashta, here I go!

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:26.670
Judau isn't really Judau
if he's not cheerful!

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.300
That's true.

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:30.380
Yeah, that's absolutely true, Ple.

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.720
Is El Goléa this way?!

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:37.230
It's as if I have no landmarks to go by!

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:46.570
What?!

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:55.040
That's a town... Is that El Goléa?

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:03.090
Some small fry has lost its way!
We'll make a pincer attack!

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:11.010
Such a powerful mobile suit team
is deployed out here?!

00:14:22.080 --> 00:14:25.370
I'd have an advantage if
we were in the clouds.

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.070
You're mine!

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:30.660
What?!

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:34.990
Reinforcements?!

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:36.990
Leave this one to me, August!

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:39.870
Go strike the AEUG base in El Goléa!

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:41.090
Roger that!

00:14:44.140 --> 00:14:46.260
They're running away?

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:54.270
Beecha, a mobile suit with
kanji on it went that way!

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:58.690
The Bawoo?! That's Glemy!

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:04.180
Mondo, I got an idea! Let's use
the Core Fighter as a shield!

00:15:04.180 --> 00:15:05.770
Use the Core Fighter as a shield?!

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:08.310
Glemy has the hots for
Roux Louka, right?

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.780
I getcha!

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:14.360
Split up! If we cluster together,
they can hit us all at once!

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:18.740
No, we have a plan of our own!
Roux, go on ahead for us!

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:22.450
You guys are trying to take
the easy way out, aren't you?!

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:23.840
That's not it!

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.790
Are you people insane?!

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:31.800
We're just trying to beat that
mobile suit with the kanji!

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:37.520
You can keep running,
but you'll go down at some point.

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:47.640
Beecha!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:50.610
It'll be worth it when
we beat that mobile suit.

00:15:50.790 --> 00:15:53.120
Mondo! Elle! Back me up!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:16:01.060
- What is the meaning of this?!
- You hear me? It's Roux Louka!

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.000
Roux Louka is in this fighter!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:06.960
Come on, Glemy, take a good look!

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:10.300
That is... Roux Louka?

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:15.470
Roux Louka is in there?!

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.970
- Are you running away?!
- Beecha! Stop this nonsense!

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:22.980
You're a great shield, so just sit there
looking all high and mighty!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:36.950
Shoot if you dare!

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:47.960
That's right. Just try attacking
this Core Fighter!

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:50.890
I can't put up with this anymore!

00:16:50.890 --> 00:16:53.040
It IS you, Roux Louka!

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.260
Miss Roux! It's me, Glemy Toto!

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:59.390
You're mine!

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:06.610
Miss Roux!

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:13.090
What a Romeo!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:16.860
Dammit, Beecha... You'll pay for this!

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:30.710
I... I swore...

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:34.630
I swore I would abandon the bloom of
my youth, and yet I still...

00:17:42.550 --> 00:17:46.640
That Glemy... He gave us an opening
just because of a girl.

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:48.600
You reap what you sow, as they say.

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:50.140
Women are scary!

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:51.370
That's not true!

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:54.060
You men just keep
lowering your guard!

00:17:54.060 --> 00:17:55.690
Gundam Team, come in!

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:57.320
Yes!

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:01.130
What are you doing there?
Head to El Goléa at once!

00:18:01.130 --> 00:18:02.660
R-Roger!

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:26.520
- Were we too late?
- It looks like it...

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:32.230
They just rope in anyone and everyone...

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:34.860
I don't know if you're
Zeon or Axis or what, but...

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.730
Judau?

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:40.700
It hurts...!

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:43.720
Cheer up, Judau!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:46.700
I don't think war is
exactly cheerful, but...

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:50.080
I think Miss Roux said something
important, in her way.

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:55.710
Look, people throughout history have died
for reasons just as ridiculous, or worse.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:19:00.090
If you're mad about all this,
then rediscover your will to fight!

00:19:01.900 --> 00:19:03.680
Iino, let's go!

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:11.860
I'll never forgive you, you scum!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.950
It's looking like we
have the advantage!

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.120
Iino, leave this area to me!

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:35.590
Thanks, Judau!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.920
Ugh! We can't even squash two flies?!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.190
It's those guys from earlier!

00:19:45.190 --> 00:19:47.090
You blew it, didn't you, Glemy?

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:49.930
All teams! We've fulfilled
our initial objective!

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:54.610
Retreat from El Goléa and return to
base! The operation is a success!

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:03.360
- They're running away?!
- Don't follow them too far, Judau!

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.700
We have to put out
the town's fires first!

00:20:53.170 --> 00:20:55.080
Damn you, August!

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:06.630
The Gundam Team
has been recovered.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:08.050
What about Roux Louka's Core Fighter?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:09.760
Not yet, sir.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:12.010
Roux Louka left the Argama?!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:15.480
Never mind Roux,
I need that Core Fighter!

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:16.760
You really mean...

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:18.310
What are you talking about?

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:21.330
We have to keep our personal feelings
in check, or everyone will die!

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:23.060
Roux disobeyed orders.

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.910
She used one of the Argama's
weapons without permission.

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.400
- She can't escape punishment!
- But that's--

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:30.900
All of you, good work!
Take time to rest!

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:33.910
Keithron! Have you picked up
any signals from the Audhumla?

00:21:33.910 --> 00:21:35.070
No, sir, not yet.

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:35.830
Hurry up!

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:38.870
- Just leave Roux alone!
- Yeah, yeah!

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:41.000
You guys didn't do anything
to Roux, did you--

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.960
They did. Beecha and Mondo
teamed up, and they--

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.250
Iino!

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:48.210
Did they get on Roux's case
over me and Leina?

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:49.810
Yeah.

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:53.010
Then it's my responsibility!

00:21:53.010 --> 00:21:58.430
Because I was crying like a baby,
Miss Roux despaired and left us.

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:03.460
A Core Fighter?

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:06.360
Can it be... that Miss Roux is there?

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:15.750
Nothing is born from sadness, Judau.

00:22:16.510 --> 00:22:20.840
You have to fight, because
that will help you keep living.

00:22:25.770 --> 00:22:28.890
Don't let sadness beat you, Judau!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:48.370 --> 00:23:52.070
Roux and Glemy lost their way and
wandered into a desert city.

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:55.610
The people who lived there
bore a profound destiny...

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:58.740
and they abhorred the
thought of going into space.

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:03.840
Between the two of them was the
heartbreaking chasm of friend and foe.

00:24:04.180 --> 00:24:07.540
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Blue Team."

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:09.540
Next Time

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:09.540
BLUE TEAM

00:24:06.420 --> 00:24:09.540
(Part 1)

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:10.490
A blue wind blows over the desert.
